  "body": "Explainer says that modifications (set, delete) require a leading `/` in paths:\r\n* https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/blob/main/explainer.md#paths\r\n\r\nTests validates this:\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/master/cookie-store/cookieStore_delete_arguments.tentative.https.any.js\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/cookie-store/cookieStore_set_arguments.tentative.https.any.js\r\n\r\nBut the spec seemingly doesn't have anything requiring this:\r\n* https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#set-cookie-algorithm\r\n\r\nAdd it to the spec?\r\n",
